{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemessosh"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Sosh theme is the theme dedicated to the Sosh brand only.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"OUDSThemesSosh","title":"Theme Sosh","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_sosh.png","type":"icon"}],"modules":[{"name":"Theme Sosh"}],"roleHeading":"Library"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Group","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshBrandColorRawTokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshBrandFontRawTokens"],"anchor":"Group"},{"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/ColorSoshBrandRawToken","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/ColorSoshDecorativeRawToken","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshBrandFontRawToken"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/OUDSThemesContract","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SwiftUICore"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"code":["🧬 Theme version: 2.6.0"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the Sosh theme any Sosh product must use, and cannot be subclassed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It embeds also in its target the Sosh brand colors which are not shared nor exposed in lower level targets or outside any module not depending to it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In other words, this ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is based on the abstract ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", uses all the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" kit and brings the Sosh brand colors and assets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Tip","style":"tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This theme embeds and registers the fonts for the Sosh theme, you just need to use the theme object as is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Sosh theme does not embed colors for charts yet and is read only: it cannot be subclassed or derivated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme","level":2,"text":"How to use the theme","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" directly. To use the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for your root view and give it an instance of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". Keep in mind the themes are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift class objects","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and can be heavy, so you may use only as instance as singleton and not store any properties.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            OUDSThemeableView(theme: SoshTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Then, in your views, you can simply use the theme through an environment variable to get the tokens:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    \/\/ Get OUDS environment variable for theme thanks to themeable view","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    ","    var body: some View {","        ","        \/\/ Use the theme to retrieve the tokens","        \/\/ For spaces: theme.spaces","        \/\/ For sizes: theme.sizes","        \/\/ For borders: theme.borders","        \/\/ For elevations: theme.elevations","        \/\/ For opacities: theme.opacities","        \/\/ For colors: theme.colors","        \/\/ For button configuration: theme.button","        \/\/ For link configuration: theme.link","        \/\/ Etc.","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"How-to-tune-the-theme","level":2,"text":"How to tune the theme","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You cannot tune the Sosh theme.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Typography","level":2,"text":"Typography","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Sosh theme uses its Sosh font and must not use others.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"How-to-enrich-the-theme","level":2,"text":"How to enrich the theme","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You cannot derivate the Sosh theme.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"How-it-looks-like","level":2,"text":"How it looks like","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Actions","level":3,"text":"Actions","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Button","level":4,"text":"Button","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/